                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A very cool 2D pinball game!\n\nThe tables are designed in an old-school style, like arcade pinball machines from the '70s and '80s. The table layouts are great, and they're genuinely fun to play.\n\nThe game runs absolutely perfectly on Steam Deck. Just increase the table zoom and remap the controls—the default layout is pretty weird.\n\nHighly recommended for all pinball fans!",
